      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<style>\n  /* General Styling */\n  .delivery-container {\n    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    color: #333;\n    max-width: 800px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 20px;\n    background: white;\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);\n  }\n\n  .delivery-container h1 {\n    font-size: 28px;\n    color: #2c3e50;\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n    background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgb(139 214 218), rgb(166 236 208));\n    -webkit-background-clip: text;\n    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\n  }\n\n  .delivery-container h2 {\n    font-size: 24px;\n    color: #2c3e50;\n    margin-top: 30px;\n    margin-bottom: 15px;\n    padding-bottom: 5px;\n    border-bottom: 2px solid rgb(139 214 218);\n  }\n\n  .delivery-container details {\n    margin-bottom: 15px;\n    border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    padding: 10px;\n    transition: all 0.3s ease;\n  }\n\n  .delivery-container details[open] {\n    background-color: #f9f9f9;\n  }\n\n  .delivery-container summary {\n    font-size: 18px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #2c3e50;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    padding: 10px 40px 10px 10px;\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(139, 214, 218, 0.1), rgba(166, 236, 208, 0.1));\n    position: relative;\n    list-style: none; /* Remove default arrow */\n  }\n\n  .delivery-container summary:hover {\n    background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(139, 214, 218, 0.2), rgba(166, 236, 208, 0.2));\n  }\n\n  /* Custom Collapsed Shape (Plus Icon) */\n  .delivery-container summary::before {\n    content: '+';\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 10px;\n    top: 50%;\n    transform: translateY(-50%);\n    font-size: 24px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: rgb(139 214 218);\n    transition: all 0.3s ease;\n  }\n\n  /* Custom Expanded Shape (Minus Icon) */\n  .delivery-container details[open] summary::before {\n    content: '-';\n    color: rgb(166 236 208);\n  }\n\n  .delivery-container p {\n    font-size: 16px;\n    margin-bottom: 15px;\n  }\n\n  .delivery-container ul {\n    margin-bottom: 15px;\n    padding-left: 20px;\n  }\n\n  .delivery-container ul li {\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n  }\n\n  .delivery-container table {\n    width: 100%;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n  }\n\n  .delivery-container table th,\n  .delivery-container table td {\n    padding: 10px;\n    border: 1px solid #ddd;\n    text-align: left;\n  }\n\n  .delivery-container table th {\n    background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgb(139 214 218), rgb(166 236 208));\n    color: white;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n\n  .delivery-container table tr:nth-child(even) {\n    background-color: #f9f9f9;\n  }\n\n  .delivery-container table tr:hover {\n    background-color: rgba(139, 214, 218, 0.1);\n  }\n\n  /* Responsive Design */\n  @media (max-width: 768px) {\n    .delivery-container {\n      padding: 15px;\n    }\n\n    .delivery-container h1 {\n      font-size: 24px;\n    }\n\n    .delivery-container h2 {\n      font-size: 20px;\n    }\n\n    .delivery-container summary {\n      font-size: 16px;\n    }\n\n    .delivery-container p {\n      font-size: 14px;\n    }\n\n    .delivery-container table th,\n    .delivery-container table td {\n      padding: 8px;\n    }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"delivery-container\">\n  <h1>Delivery at 4Phones</h1>\n\n  <details>\n    <summary>How long is the delivery time for my order?</summary>\n    <p>Delivery times vary by country and zip code area. If you have placed your order before 19:30h, it will be shipped the same day. All our orders are shipped from our warehouse in the Netherlands. Almost all packages for the Netherlands, Belgium, Germany, Portugal, Denmark, England, France, Switzerland, and Italy will be delivered the next day. For other countries, remote areas, and islands, the delivery may take 1 or 2 days longer. The transport service determines the route of your order.</p>\n  </details>\n\n  <details>\n    <summary>When will my order be shipped?</summary>\n    <p>We ship our packages from Monday to Friday until 19:30. Customers from the Netherlands and Belgium (only in regions where PostNL operates) who place an order on Friday will receive it on Saturday. Customers from other countries will receive their order placed on Friday the following Monday.</p>\n  </details>\n\n  <details>\n    <summary>With which delivery service will my package be delivered?</summary>\n    <p>We work with PostNL and UPS. PostNL delivers in the Netherlands and border areas in Belgium. UPS provides our deliveries throughout Europe.</p>\n  </details>\n\n  <details>\n    <summary>Where is my order?</summary>\n    <p>In your order confirmation, you will find the track & trace code. So you can check where your package is at all times.</p>\n  </details>\n\n  <details>\n    <summary>Can I change my delivery address?</summary>\n    <p>Yes, you can! Log in, go to ‘Account & Settings’, and change your delivery address in your address book. Please note! Once an order has been placed, the address cannot be changed. So make sure you check your delivery address carefully before placing the order.</p>\n  </details>\n\n  <details>\n    <summary>Do I have to pay for delivery?</summary>\n    <p>This depends on your order amount and delivery address. You can find it all in the tables below:</p>\n\n    <h2>Netherlands & Belgium</h2>\n    <h3>POSTNL (Including Saturday Delivery)</h3>\n    <table>\n      <thead>\n        <tr>\n          <th>Order Amount</th>\n          <th>Shipping Cost</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr>\n          <td>> €100</td>\n          <td>Free Shipping</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>≤ €100</td>\n          <td>€5,95</td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h3>UPS Express Saver 1-2 Days</h3>\n    <table>\n      <thead>\n        <tr>\n          <th>Order Amount</th>\n          <th>Shipping Cost</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr>\n          <td>> €100</td>\n          <td>Free Shipping</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>≤ €100</td>\n          <td>€5,95</td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h2>FI, CR, IE, SI, HU, EE, BG, CZ, EL, HR, LT, LV, MT, RO, SK, CY, GB, PL, NO, CH</h2>\n    <h3>UPS Express Saver 1-2 Days</h3>\n    <table>\n      <thead>\n        <tr>\n          <th>Order Amount</th>\n          <th>Shipping Cost</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr>\n          <td>> €200</td>\n          <td>Free Shipping</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>≤ €200</td>\n          <td>€22,50</td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h2>PT, DE, AT, LU, IT, DK, FR, SE, ES</h2>\n    <h3>UPS Standard 3-5 Days</h3>\n    <table>\n      <thead>\n        <tr>\n          <th>Order Amount</th>\n          <th>Shipping Cost</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr>\n          <td>> €150</td>\n          <td>Free Shipping</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>≤ €150</td>\n          <td>€6.95</td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h3>UPS Express Saver 1-2 Days</h3>\n    <table>\n      <thead>\n        <tr>\n          <th>Order Amount</th>\n          <th>Shipping Cost</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr>\n          <td>> €200</td>\n          <td>Free Shipping</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>€150 - €200</td>\n          <td>€7,95</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>≤ €150</td>\n          <td>€9,95</td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h2>Portugal Exceptions (9000 - 9999)</h2>\n    <h3>UPS Express Saver 1-2 Days</h3>\n    <table>\n      <thead>\n        <tr>\n          <th>Order Amount</th>\n          <th>Shipping Cost</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr>\n          <td>> €350</td>\n          <td>Free Shipping</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>€350 - €200</td>\n          <td>€15,00</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>≤ €200</td>\n          <td>€25,00</td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h2>Unlisted Countries</h2>\n    <p>Please contact support if your destination country is not listed. We will set up custom pricing for your specific country.</p>\n    <p><a href=\"mailto:support@4phones.nl\">Contact support!</a></p>\n  </details>\n</div>",
